@namespace DotNetNuke.Modules.Journal
@inherits DotNetNuke.Modules.Journal.JournalModuleBase

@*
    Replaces Edit.ascx, whose entire content was the single <%@ Control %> directive - it declared
    no markup at all. This component therefore renders nothing, exactly as the original control
    did, and exists for the same reason: Journal.dnn registers an "Edit" module control and the
    class must stay available for it.

    The lifecycle body (the Page_Load try / Exceptions.ProcessModuleLoadException shape with its
    intentionally empty edit body) is preserved in Edit.razor.cs.
*@
